{'symbol': 'FCX', 'date': '2022-03-23 08:30:00', 'title': 'FREEPORT-MCMORAN DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDENDS ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': "PHOENIX, ARIZ.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FREEPORT-MCMORAN INC. (NYSE: FCX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED CASH DIVIDENDS OF $0.15 PER SHARE ON FCX'S COMMON STOCK PAYABLE ON MAY 2, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF APRIL 14, 2022. THESE DIVIDENDS ARE BEING PAID CONSISTENT WITH FCX'S PERFORMANCE-BASED PAYOUT FRAMEWORK, WHICH INCLUDES A BASE AND VARIABLE DIVIDEND, ANNOUNCED IN NOVEMBER 2021. FREEPORT: FOREMOST IN COPPER FCX IS A LEADING INTERNATIONAL MINING COMPANY WITH HEADQUART"}